# Source Registry

Change registry files only. Do not add scrapers, fetchers, or a database here.

## Required fields

`source_id`, `name`, `canonical_url`, `category`, `owner`, `official`, `fetch_method`, `priority`, `enabled`, `robots_status`, `terms_url`, `reuse_status`, `allowed_fields`, `fulltext_storage_allowed`, `image_reuse_allowed`, `commercial_use_status`, `attribution_required`, `fetch_interval_minutes`, `confidence_weight`, `last_reviewed_at`, `notes`

## Rules

- `source_id` is unique kebab-case
- `canonical_url` must be `http`/`https`
- `reuse_status` is only `OPEN` | `FACTS_ONLY` | `LICENSED` | `REVIEW_REQUIRED` | `PROHIBITED`
- If `reuse_status=PROHIBITED`, `enabled` must be `false` (`canEnable` / `withEnabled`)
- Uncertain permission → `REVIEW_REQUIRED`. Do not mark `LICENSED`/`OPEN` without evidence
- Telegram, Yandex Maps, 2GIS stay `PROHIBITED` and disabled

```ts
// ❌ BAD
{ reuse_status: "PROHIBITED", enabled: true }

// ✅ GOOD
{ reuse_status: "PROHIBITED", enabled: false }
```
